  {
   "id": "if-you-re-a-ghost-call-me-here-151762@major-2022-12-26",
   "gameId": "if-you-re-a-ghost-call-me-here-151762",
   "displayName": "We're working on the update right now!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-12-26T15:27:57.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We had actually planned to update this game in time for the STEAM Winter Sale, but due to unexpected bug problems, the fix is long overdue!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This game will be updated in two parts.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. 100 consecutive calls, and a new story.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Vanitas will try to master his craft by making 100 consecutive calls! And the more calls he clears, the more new stories will be released.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. The story of each character's past.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The story of each character's past will revolve around the reaper days of Ars and Memento.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "First, 100 consecutive calls are scheduled to be updated. We would like to update it by the end of 2022 as much as possible, but will we be able to do it in time...!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Translated with www.DeepL.com/Translator (free version)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
